      {
        "id": 127010,
        "name": "Silverleaf",
        "username": "Silverleaf",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-21T02:51:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The game will still exist if they stop making expansions. You can still enjoy it!</p><p>I for one don't want &gt;G to churn out expansion after expansion way beyond what feels like a natural stopping point. There's only so much you can do before you run out of interesting new ideas and mechanisms, and it would be sad to see SotM end up like Munchkin that Just. Won't. Die.</p><p>I'm pretty sure that Christopher has a lot more stories to tell that aren't necessarily Sentinels-related, and I'm excited to see what's coming after this arc. There's Tactics of course, but what else?</p>",
