        "id": 127011,
        "name": "tarsonas",
        "username": "tarsonas",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ecae2f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-21T03:32:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I sincerely hope that once the new official content for SotM is done, that we can work on and produce some legit fan Expansions.With the community we have we could make some great decks. &nbsp;It would of course depend on the legal situation, but it would be awesome if we could do it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>well we do have some at BBG. Like cauldron (no story) and the collective (story but currently no artist) .&nbsp;</p>",
